{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U6QX5E2dHrtHZGjYxqXBhQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:33.201538+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U6QX5E2dHrtHZGjYxqXBhQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ibdianibpxPyjzOB2G3WOVCozNdu7Kg1RDIiarUILOibNVhicS9R4es22KlRVELFKzJaPyabV2CyicWbjb4qeBznNF7fCjckUPkDy3mhTp5DUQVV4o/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibdianibpxPyjxc4sMAB3fWMUVciaksv0onave4S1MviaGgibHwf64DB1Lsib7m1hn6zgEibuMnibae6ic1Kz2HE67NkHPgzZSqhcnicLk0BUth1XftRibU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>上海交通大学安泰经管学院优才营（金融硕士营）即将于</span><strong><span>2026年7月</span></strong><span>进行，报名通道现已正式开启，欢迎来自全国各大高校的大三学生及时申请。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>2、本科三年级在校生（2027年应届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>3、</span><strong><span>能获得本科所在院校的推免研究生资格</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>4、英语水平优秀，数理基础扎实；</span></p><p><span>5、专业不限，</span><strong><span>欢迎跨专业同学报考</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名网址</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>https://applyitf.sjtu.edu.cn/apply/jrzs/#/login</span></span></p><p><span>点击文末“阅读原文”即可登陆该网址</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>获得交大安泰优才营入营资格的营员，需登录上海交通大学研究生网申系统进行填报，具体流程请查看邮件通知。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>*上海交通大学研究生网申系统网址：</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl</span></strong></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>报名已开放，申请材料详见系统</span></p><p><span>*</span><strong><span>报名截止时间为2026年7月9日上午10点整</span></strong></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>① 请务必准确填写手机和邮箱等个人联络信息，以免错过后续重要通知；</span></p><p><span>② 金融硕士营和交大安泰其他项目优才营仅能申请一个；</span></p><p><span>③ 本项目设有研究方向：行业研究与产业金融，金融科技与量化投资，科创金融。在报名阶段不分研究方向，但需明确个人研究方向意愿，详见系统；</span></p><p><span>④ 系统提交的所有信息和辅助材料必须真实有效，否则将取消入营资格；</span></p><p><span>⑤ 营员须全程参加优才营活动，具体活动及日程安排请关注后续通知；</span></p><p><span>⑥ 交大安泰优才营（金融硕士营）为营员提供活动期间在沪的校内伙食。交通和住宿由营员自理；</span></p><p><span>⑦ 本活动最终解释权归上海交通大学安泰经管学院金融硕士项目组所有。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>祝同学们鱼跃龙门，圆梦交大，</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>如愿进入交大安泰金融硕士！</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>关于交大安泰金融硕士MF</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>1998年，上海交通大学获准设立金融学硕士学位点，并于1999年招收第一届金融硕士（学术型）学生；2011年，交大安泰经管学院获准招收金融硕士专业学位研究生，首届金融硕士（专业型）学生入学。交大安泰金融硕士项目立足上海国际金融中心建设，服务全国经济转型和升级，融合本土化和国际化，致力于培养掌握现代金融理论、具备深厚产业底蕴、熟谙中国金融制度和文化、胸怀国际格局的高层次创新型复合人才。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibdianibpxPyjzqXTnZ4d7ibJrPicznBPBcQh9GS3aibXYr1FjqwHckhdakdLp3T4PfuwTJR1LDJQwYQuaUxTq8avjQ1xF4ibfxiauHAbQVUqM2rz18/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>经过多年发展，交大安泰金融硕士项目一体化的人才培养体系已经为社会输出了大批高级金融专业人才，业界口碑极佳，学生发展优秀。如今，迈入第二个百年征程的交大安泰，正以“纵横交错、知行合一”战略为指导，以行业研究（行业研究院）与科技金融（中银科技金融学院）双轮驱动高质量发展，努力建设成为一所扎根中国的世界级商学院。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ibdianibpxPyjxicBzmfqU2Ea5JEztl5nZRFgnbRQEVCHfOmB05qeshhzTF8tiakTm7F34h7GthXlEFb4MIYcrUDTQ3libeaj8GvsLzfEicsic7yLnY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>上海交大中银科技金融学院教学服务中心</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>地址：上海市华山路1954号，上海交通大学浩然高科技大厦605室</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：021-62933105、021-62933016</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：itf.mf@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>网址：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://itf.sjtu.edu.cn/itf/mf/index.html</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 推荐阅读 </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247550332&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=606ae00d045459e721d515cc1d0845a3&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibdianibpxPyjx6sEdTxnLTGsJnF43LUeBNURbWzNYOwK1UbpGXTpVOLqfeaQu60nEWUMFMHj51rrqX1ICGHjFRqic70JuN7e91wLKK3j2XpmOw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></a></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247550332&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=606ae00d045459e721d515cc1d0845a3&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">全球六强！交大安泰MF学子</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247550332&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=606ae00d045459e721d515cc1d0845a3&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">在这场赛事中创历史最佳成绩</a></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247549971&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=116ad5bb75394cf6b056e0d561aed73c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibdianibpxPyjy7iaQ9NPSdgKkenSiaibCjq64ImSnRnS4BrdbvpvaIaxPeMYCoXPwTksGwJMKNebBTucGJ7vZ6zfH2AAJAPIacKeo3oCSooricTUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247549971&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=116ad5bb75394cf6b056e0d561aed73c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">不负韶华，和光同行！交大安泰MF项目15周年</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247549971&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=116ad5bb75394cf6b056e0d561aed73c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">主题曲《追光》MV首发上线</a></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247551041&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=91dbf3077a67ef7b9900fde3640e9856&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ibdianibpxPyjx1s6ml0IMRT0a8HXZCwVzib1lziaicV0Ikoj0u93vBOnkvpBcFN4YPjApTN622IE1y5CukibTAlnCV8ukFFy27qiczzRuyibWuETzibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247551041&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=91dbf3077a67ef7b9900fde3640e9856&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">追光之路｜25级MF学生刘博远：</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjMzMDU4Ng==&amp;mid=2247551041&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=91dbf3077a67ef7b9900fde3640e9856&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">探索未知，洞察世界</a></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibdianibpxPyjzziaXlWs4Q4abc4fkQ5jTgMh9vnaGpicWibdnA77vZAkicVmL14eTwcSNBLGLZTM0Ifiaew6tcpU8yOC1yczt3mf19F5aBhgGZp9v8/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>关于交大科金</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>上海交通大学中银科技金融学院成立于2022年2月，是上海交通大学在国家发改委、教育部等部委和上海市的大力支持下，与中国银行开展合作，由安泰经济与管理学院按照国际一流标准建设的全球化、平台化、开放化的科技金融学院。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>在上海交通大学、中国银行，以及广大学界、业界领袖的支持下，交大科金锐意进取、开拓创新，积极承担起人才培养、交叉科研、成果转化、高端智库等职能。同时学院也在成果转化方法论研究、师生创新创业培育、多元激励机制试点等方面探索融为一体的模式与路径，充分发挥产学研创新主体的协同效应，落实立德树人根本任务，打造融汇“产、学、研、创、用”各方资源的聚合型平台，力争为我国高校科技成果转化的模式创新与实践探索提供一套成熟定型、可复制推广的方案，贡献交大智慧。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ibdianibpxPyjwgw6mx58Fsf2nhsrf0qYqvBdUcZ6jwNEQicvicjhZ5KOHyicOlW6YHMpIZYN04y8OwSFNnfmKK59H7DE6S8d1gUB7yEOWSLrxung/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ibdianibpxPyjyrt26d16vj0UZKrKGan0xWT6Z7XPSk0jgu1jGTYNDLodRVjUaVv0O4KpOREM9flg6VGmTL9H5AtMuzibZtfG5PgicqC8xhC967Y/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>点击“阅读原文”报名优才营</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>点赞</span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/04dJ6spx8ibOzn2kYCAjaqdiaVza8qqeRGgTHoD7oh47Lsg1d5cZTvJ7Ew9Rx7m31KOgeicEBZLJoYh3d3Hql5ibIw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2f74669baa30987ea35fdf8e973d708e87517cf1ee1482399cc32a4a72ff5674","textLength":1614,"sourceSha256":"f1dc11d410d6889d6ccc0a690db0b129fd61eb5e6c5b60fce6d904dd0680ed85","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8c6bd7361fd21a985d3b","title":"2026年上海交通大学安泰经济与管理学院金融硕士2027级优才营报名正式启动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:33.201538+00:00"}
